<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="주 메뉴">
    <nav>
        <p class="nav-section">WorkBridge</p>
        <c:forEach var="menu" items="${navigationMenus}">
            <c:choose>
                <c:when test="${not empty menu.children}">
                    <p class="nav-section nav-parent"><c:out value="${menu.menuName}"/></p>
                    <c:forEach var="child" items="${menu.children}">
                        <a class="nav-item ${child.menuCode eq activeMenu ? 'active' : ''}"
                           href="<c:url value='${child.menuPath}'/>">
                            <span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
                            <c:out value="${child.menuName}"/>
                        </a>
                    </c:forEach>
                </c:when>
                <c:when test="${not empty menu.menuPath}">
                    <a class="nav-item ${menu.menuCode eq activeMenu ? 'active' : ''}"
                       href="<c:url value='${menu.menuPath}'/>">
                        <span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">•</span>
                        <c:out value="${menu.menuName}"/>
                    </a>
                </c:when>
                <c:otherwise>
                    <p class="nav-section nav-parent"><c:out value="${menu.menuName}"/></p>
                </c:otherwise>
            </c:choose>
        </c:forEach>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-note">
        <strong>영업지원·전자결재 데모</strong>
        <p>웹은 HttpSession·CSRF, 모바일은 JWT·회전형 Refresh Token으로 분리했습니다.</p>
    </div>
</aside>
